msgid "When the visitor asks for a human, the AI waits this many minutes for an operator. If no operator replies in that time, the AI answers the messages the visitor sent meanwhile (1-1440)."
msgstr "訪客要求真人後，AI 等候客服接手的分鐘數；這段時間內沒有客服回覆，AI 會回答訪客在等候期間寫的訊息（1-1440）。"

